          },
          "blocks": {
            "row_1": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do you decide what to offer?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Every offer comes down to four things: condition, authenticity, demand and current market value. Prices in this hobby move constantly, so an offer reflects where the market sits when we look at your cards rather than a fixed price list. We'll always explain how we got there.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text"
              ]
            },
            "row_2": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What do I need to send with my enquiry?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>For each item: the card name, the set it's from, the card number and an honest description of condition. Clear, well-lit photos of the front and back make a big difference, particularly for corners, edges and surface. For a large collection, a rough summary plus photos of the notable cards is a good starting point.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text"
              ]
            },
            "row_3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does sending an enquiry commit me to selling?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. An enquiry is the start of a conversation, nothing more. You're under no obligation to accept an offer, and you're free to sell elsewhere or simply keep your cards.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text"
              ]
            },
            "row_4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How and when do I get paid?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We'll agree the amount and the payment method with you before anything is sent, and confirm it in writing. We don't quote fixed timescales up front because it depends on the deal and how the cards arrive — but you'll know what to expect before you commit to anything.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text"
              ]
            },
            "row_5": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do you buy whole collections and bulk?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Binders, boxes, job lots and full collections are all welcome, and we're happy to look at everything rather than cherry-picking. Send a rough idea of the size and era, along with photos of anything you think stands out.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
